WEBVTT

00:08.800 --> 00:15.410
<b>Picking up the yesterday
that someone threw away</b>

00:15.410 --> 00:18.750
<b>I just reached my hand
out like a daredevil</b>

00:18.750 --> 00:22.050
<b>Thrusting the answer out</b>

00:22.050 --> 00:27.490
<b>No matter what I get, I
won't ever be satisfied</b>

00:28.690 --> 00:34.630
<b>Escape from the gaps in
your tangled up heart</b>

00:34.630 --> 00:36.700
<b>That's right, make a treasure</b>

00:36.700 --> 00:41.940
<b>I hear your voice
in the rusted time</b>

00:41.940 --> 00:44.970
<b>I want to deliver it just as it is</b>

00:44.970 --> 00:48.240
<b>You are waiting in the light</b>

00:48.240 --> 00:51.850
<b>That's what I believe</b>

00:51.850 --> 00:55.510
<b>Right away</b>

01:06.060 --> 01:08.100
<b>So, make a treasure</b>

01:08.100 --> 01:13.340
<b>I search for myself
in the rusted mirror</b>

01:13.340 --> 01:16.440
<b>I want to seize it
with my own hands</b>

01:16.440 --> 01:19.670
<b>You are waiting, no
matter where I am</b>

01:19.670 --> 01:23.250
<b>That's what I believe</b>

01:23.250 --> 01:25.910
<b>Right away</b>

01:43.900 --> 01:45.370
<b>Oh, sorry.</b>

01:49.400 --> 01:50.870
<b>Golden eyes...</b>

01:51.410 --> 01:52.110
<b>Bye!</b>

01:52.110 --> 01:52.910
<b>Hey, kid.
Bye!</b>

01:52.910 --> 01:53.740
<b>Hey, kid.</b>

01:53.740 --> 01:55.540
<b>Ow, what'd you do that for?!</b>

01:56.240 --> 01:58.410
<b>Are you the Goku who was brought
to the Merciful Goddess</b>

01:58.410 --> 02:00.400
<b>that Tenpou was talking about?</b>

02:01.980 --> 02:05.720
<b>What? Mister, are you
Tenchan's friend?</b>

02:05.720 --> 02:08.450
<b>I ain't a mister! It's big brother.</b>

02:09.930 --> 02:11.390
<b>General Kenren!</b>

02:12.430 --> 02:13.930
<b>That child was wandering</b>

02:13.930 --> 02:16.900
<b>in the Jade Emperor's
castle without permission.</b>

02:16.900 --> 02:19.160
<b>Goodness knows how he got in.</b>

02:20.370 --> 02:22.370
<b>Oh, he's okay.</b>

02:22.370 --> 02:25.210
<b>What? General Kenren,
do you know him?</b>

02:25.210 --> 02:26.940
<b>Well, more like...</b>

02:28.880 --> 02:30.850
<b>He's my illegitimate kid.</b>

02:30.850 --> 02:32.310
<b>Illeg...</b>

02:37.320 --> 02:40.120
