palace is separate, isn't it?</b>

02:59.810 --> 03:05.010
<b>Yeah, it was in this palace
I met Nataku the other day.</b>

03:05.010 --> 03:06.180
<b>Nataku?</b>

03:06.180 --> 03:06.510
<b>That's why I came all this way
looking for him.
Nataku?</b>

03:06.510 --> 03:09.020
<b>That's why I came all this way
looking for him.</b>

03:09.020 --> 03:13.320
<b>Hey, wait a minute. By Nataku,
do you mean War Prince Nataku?</b>

03:13.320 --> 03:15.660
