03:15.660 --> 03:18.890
<b>The last time we met, I
still didn't have a name,</b>

03:18.890 --> 03:20.700
<b>so I thought I ought to tell him.</b>

03:20.700 --> 03:25.130
<b>What do you know? The puppet
assassin has a friend.</b>

03:25.130 --> 03:25.730
<b>What?</b>

03:25.730 --> 03:26.640
<b>Nothing, just talking to myself.
What?</b>

03:26.640 --> 03:27.190
<b>Nothing, just talking to myself.</b>

03:28.270 --> 03:31.210
<b>Nataku's out in the
Lower World right now.</b>

03:31.210 --> 03:33.640
<b>What? He's not here?</b>

03:33.640 --> 03:35.480
<b>He'll come back any day now,</b>

03:35.480 --> 03:37.810
<b>so why don't you come
visit him again later?</b>

03:37.810 --> 03:39.280
<b>Okay.</b>

03:41.780 --> 03:44.190
<b>Are you really heavy or what?</b>

03:44.190 --> 03:45.780
<b>What? Oh, yeah.</b>

03:46.920 --> 03:48.390
<b>Because I have these on.</b>

03:49.960 --> 03:52.460
<b>These shackles?</b>

03:52.460 --> 03:56.130
<b>This kid has these things on and
moves around like it's no problem?</b>

03:56.130 --> 03:58.570
<b>No, more importantly,</b>

03:58.570 --> 04:02.560
<b>does it means he's so dangerous
they have to do this to him?</b>

04:04.940 --> 04:06.570
<b>What the heck...</b>

04:06.570 --> 04:08.540
<b>General Kenren!</b>

04:08.540 --> 04:09.540
<b>Yo!</b>

04:09.540 --> 04:10.050
<b>Prince Nataku has returned from
subjugating Gyumaoh.
Yo!</b>

