<b>Prince Nataku has returned from
subjugating Gyumaoh.</b>

04:12.850 --> 04:14.310
<b>What? Really?</b>

04:15.880 --> 04:17.420
<b>Is something the matter?</b>

04:17.420 --> 04:19.890
<b>No, that is...</b>

04:19.890 --> 04:21.920
