04:43.210 --> 04:44.680
<b>Nataku!</b>

04:45.650 --> 04:47.480
<b>Nataku, you okay?!</b>

04:48.420 --> 04:50.790
<b>You're the guy I met...</b>

04:50.790 --> 04:51.190
<b>Lord Nataku! Lord Nataku!
Lord Nataku!
You're the guy I met...</b>

04:51.190 --> 04:53.810
<b>Lord Nataku! Lord Nataku!
Lord Nataku!</b>

04:54.790 --> 04:56.690
<b>Nataku!</b>

04:56.690 --> 04:58.160
<b>Nataku!</b>

04:58.730 --> 05:00.730
<b>Nataku!</b>

05:00.730 --> 05:02.750
<b>Hey, Tenpou.</b>

05:05.370 --> 05:07.860
<b>You off in your own world again?</b>

05:09.800 --> 05:11.270
<b>I'm coming in, Tenpou.</b>

05:13.210 --> 05:16.140
<b>Sheesh, I helped you
clean up just a month ago,</b>

05:16.140 --> 05:17.700
<b>and you've already
made a mess of it?</b>

05:18.510 --> 05:20.000
<b>Hey, Tenpou!</b>

05:20.880 --> 05:22.350
<b>Yes?</b>

05:23.920 --> 05:28.060
<b>Don't "yes" me! Do you know
how many times I called out?!</b>

05:28.060 --> 05:32.530
<b>Oh, I'm sorry. I didn't notice at all.</b>

05:32.530 --> 05:34.330
<b>At all?</b>

05:34.330 --> 05:36.730
<b>I was reading about the military
history of the Lower World,</b>

05:36.730 --> 05:38.460
<b>and I couldn't stop.</b>

05:39.630 --> 05:43.040
<b>War is truly the visage
of mankind itself.</b>

05:43.910 --> 05:46.270
<b>An ideology that's the absence
of ideology crops up frequently</b>

05:46.270 --> 05:49.510
<b>in their history, and it's
presumptuous for such an ideology</b>

05:49.510 --> 05:53.180
<b>to try and establish a peaceful
state, but they strike a balance...</b>

05:53.180 --> 05:54.680
<b>You know, pardon me,</b>

05:54.680 --> 05:58.310
<b>but I didn't come here to
listen to your erudition.</b>

06:02.120 --> 06:06.230
<b>Prince Nataku's back from
subjugating Gyumaoh.</b>

06:06.230 --> 06:08.430
<b>That was certainly fast.</b>

06:08.430 --> 06:11.330
