08:40.320 --> 08:42.650
<b>Hiding places no one else knows about</b>

08:42.650 --> 08:45.250
<b>and places where there are
lots of raspberries.</b>

08:45.250 --> 08:47.850
<b>I'll go, I'll go!
I wouldn't miss it!</b>

08:48.490 --> 08:50.790
<b>No, you gotta stay in bed still.</b>

08:50.790 --> 08:52.490
<b>I'll go get someone.</b>

08:53.700 --> 08:55.200
<b>What?</b>

08:55.200 --> 08:57.100
<b>Never mind, just stay here.</b>

09:01.600 --> 09:03.070
<b>Lord Konzen.</b>

09:03.070 --> 09:08.110
<b>Lord Konzen, we had no idea you
were that child's guardian.</b>

09:08.110 --> 09:09.540
<b>I ain't his guardian.</b>

09:10.250 --> 09:11.800
<b>I'm his owner.</b>

09:13.480 --> 09:15.420
<b>Sorry to have troubled you.
I'll take him home.</b>

