a threat to this plan, then...</b>

10:37.070 --> 10:41.600
<b>Fine, dispose of them however you
will as soon as you find them.</b>

10:41.600 --> 10:42.870
<b>As you wish.</b>

10:42.870 --> 10:43.100
<b>Li Touten, is Prince Nataku
not a problem?
As you wish.</b>

10:43.100 --> 10:47.080
<b>Li Touten, is Prince Nataku
not a problem?</b>

