14:56.460 --> 14:59.990
<b>To think that eccentric and
unsociable Konzen Douji</b>

14:59.990 --> 15:03.900
<b>dotes on a child like this
from who knows where.</b>

15:03.900 --> 15:05.530
<b>I guess his disinterest in women</b>

15:05.530 --> 15:08.700
