<b>What the heck? You've got something
interesting going on over here.</b>

16:22.010 --> 16:23.740
<b>Lemme join in too.</b>

16:23.740 --> 16:29.180
<b>Oh, dear, here's the person who's
going to aggravate things.</b>

16:29.180 --> 16:31.850
<b>General Kenren, even
you will not be forgiven</b>

16:31.850 --> 16:33.880
<b>for any outrage before
the Jade Emperor!</b>

16:35.360 --> 16:40.430
<b>I was getting tired of that damn
boring old geezer's speech anyway.</b>

16:40.430 --> 16:42.530
<b>This will be a perfect
way to wake myself up!</b>

16:42.530 --> 16:46.020
<b>Everyone who's been holding a
grudge against me, come and get me!</b>

16:47.740 --> 16:50.260
<b>You just had to rile them, didn't you?</b>

16:51.340 --> 16:52.310
<b>Damn it!</b>

16:52.310 --> 16:52.840
<b>How dare you mock us?!
Damn it!</b>

16:52.840 --> 16:53.770
<b>How dare you mock us?!</b>

17:01.080 --> 17:02.980
<b>What fun this is!</b>

17:02.980 --> 17:05.680
<b>You certainly seem to have
attracted a lot of grudges.</b>

17:06.620 --> 17:08.690
<b>Shut up!</b>

17:08.690 --> 17:13.090
<b>Grudges against me are practically
the same as grudges against you!</b>

17:13.090 --> 17:17.000
<b>What? I didn't know we
were so inseparable.</b>

17:18.770 --> 17:20.230
<b>How unexpected.</b>

17:20.570 --> 17:22.600
<b>They're awesome!</b>

17:22.600 --> 17:25.440
<b>They're both so strong!
And it looks like fun!</b>

17:27.710 --> 17:29.180
<b>Tenchan! Watch out!</b>

17:30.710 --> 17:32.740
<b>Whoa! Not bad, little monkey!</b>

17:33.910 --> 17:35.050
<b>Don't call me a monkey!</b>

17:35.050 --> 17:35.580
<b>And the sole cause of the
situations that befall us...
Don't call me a monkey!</b>

17:35.580 --> 17:36.980
<b>And the sole cause of the
situations that befall us...
What're you doing?!</b>

17:36.980 --> 17:38.920
<b>And the sole cause of the
situations that befall us...
Quickly, quiet down the ruckus!</b>

17:41.320 --> 17:42.790
<b>That man again.</b>

17:43.660 --> 17:44.930
<b>What is it?</b>

17:44.930 --> 17:45.160
<b>Well, it seems some rabble in
the square started an uproar.
What is it?</b>

17:45.160 --> 17:49.430
<b>Well, it seems some rabble in
the square started an uproar.</b>

17:51.970 --> 17:53.570
<b>It's him!</b>

17:53.570 --> 17:55.030
<b>How worthless.</b>

17:55.940 --> 18:00.170
<b>It's sad to see there are so
many of such base character.</b>

18:01.380 --> 18:04.080
<b>Do you not think so, Nataku?</b>

18:04.080 --> 18:05.950
<b>Yes.</b>

18:05.950 --> 18:07.680
<b>I can't even reach my hand out.</b>

18:08.280 --> 18:11.010
<b>The world of freedom
beyond this railing...</b>

18:11.850 --> 18:13.950
<b>Hey, stop the commotion!</b>

18:13.950 --> 18:15.920
<b>Silence! Silence!</b>

18:18.390 --> 18:21.760
<b>See, Jiroushin? Isn't it such
an entertaining sideshow?</b>

18:21.760 --> 18:24.700
<b>I can't help but feel sorry
for the Jade Emperor.</b>

18:24.700 --> 18:27.300
<b>Well, what's wrong with it?</b>

18:27.300 --> 18:31.070
<b>They do say fire and fights
are the highlights of Edo.</b>

18:31.070 --> 18:33.230
<b>Where is this Edo place?</b>

18:34.340 --> 18:35.810
<b>Goku! Goku!</b>

18:36.710 --> 18:38.770
<b>What the hell are you doing,
you bastard?!</b>

18:40.550 --> 18:42.980
<b>Oh, here comes your owner.</b>

18:44.050 --> 18:45.550
<b>Konzen!</b>

18:45.550 --> 18:49.150
<b>So, this is the guy.</b>

18:50.490 --> 18:55.000
<b>You stupid monkey, I told
you to stay close to me!</b>

18:55.000 --> 18:56.460
<b>I said I was sorry!</b>

18:57.130 --> 19:02.570
<b>Hey, man, kids will be kids, he's
at that playful stage, so...</b>

19:02.570 --> 19:04.040
<b>Don't touch me!</b>

19:04.570 --> 19:06.270
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

19:06.270 --> 19:11.210
<b>The unruly general. Quote, includes
lower half of body, end quote.</b>

19:11.750 --> 19:14.110
<b>General Kenren, then.</b>

19:15.380 --> 19:19.290
<b>Lord Konzen, I didn't find
you in your seat up there,</b>

19:19.290 --> 19:20.880
<b>so this is where you were!</b>

19:21.420 --> 19:23.720
<b>Please return to your seat at once!</b>

19:23.720 --> 19:25.360
<b>No.</b>

19:25.360 --> 19:27.660
<b>These three are with me.</b>

19:27.660 --> 19:31.270
<b>I'll take responsibility for
the commotion and withdraw.</b>

19:31.270 --> 19:32.770
<b>But my Lord...</b>

19:32.770 --> 19:34.270
<b>Let's go.</b>

19:34.270 --> 19:39.430
<b>Are you sure? We went off and
started the commotion on our own.</b>

19:40.510 --> 19:42.940
<b>I just have an excuse
to skip the event now.</b>

19:52.220 --> 19:53.690
<b>Those four...</b>

19:54.660 --> 19:56.120
<b>...are dangerous.</b>

19:59.990 --> 20:03.120
<b>You've got a nice group of
people that suit you, Konzen.</b>

20:03.960 --> 20:05.960
<b>Take good care of them now.</b>

20:06.770 --> 20:11.860
<b>You're going to be bound
by a strong thread of fate.</b>

20:46.440 --> 20:55.250
<b>All people coming and
going carry heavy burdens</b>

20:56.620 --> 21:07.020
<b>Find tomorrow within the mirage
wavering in the distance</b>

21:08.360 --> 21:18.500
<b>Emotions like the sand
spilling out of my hands</b>

21:19.840 --> 21:32.820
<b>The words that pierced my
heart back then suddenly ache</b>

21:32.820 --> 21:44.260
<b>Counting the endless nights,
I search for pieces of me</b>

21:44.260 --> 21:55.540
<b>The more I lose, the more
certain this feeling becomes</b>

21:55.540 --> 22:07.720
<b>Now, I can surely
walk on and on forever</b>
